<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 34-3/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 34-3/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 34-3/8 in New York on Monday. It recorded the day's low of 34 and the day's high of 35-1/2.</p>
<p>Volume was 397,000 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 297,800.</p>
<p>It previous close on Friday was 35-1/8. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
